From 74c915df3c0495d0dad84f2fe13ff5d4645f6031 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Wed, 8 Apr 2026 20:01:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/a2xx: invalidate SQ state before shader upload

Add CP_INVALIDATE_STATE before uploading shader instructions to ensure
the shader queue doesn't use stale cached state from previous draws.

This is another attempt to fix the random faceted rendering issue where
smooth shading randomly switches to flat shading mid-run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ...orce-SQ_INTERPOLATOR_CNTL-on-every-d.patch | 50 +++++++++++++++
 ...nitialize-PA_SU_SC_MODE_CNTL-in-fd2_.patch | 64 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../drivers/freedreno/a2xx/fd2_program.c      |  9 +++
 3 files changed, 123 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 0001-freedreno-a2xx-force-SQ_INTERPOLATOR_CNTL-on-every-d.patch
 create mode 100644 0001-freedreno-a2xx-initialize-PA_SU_SC_MODE_CNTL-in-fd2_.patch

diff --git a/0001-freedreno-a2xx-force-SQ_INTERPOLATOR_CNTL-on-every-d.patch b/0001-freedreno-a2xx-force-SQ_INTERPOLATOR_CNTL-on-every-d.patch
